  <name>Glaxium</name>
  <summary>Scrolling 2D spaceship shooter</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Glaxium is an OpenGL-based space-ship "shoot-em-up" styled game.
      It is designed to provide the same feel as the old 2D games 
      of that type, but with 3D for the special effects.
    </p>
    <p>
      Destroy every-thing and especially the dark boxes that may
      contain interesting things like POWER-UP.
    </p>
  </description>
